alibri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>Model for Glucose Transport</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:cxnSp><p:nvCxnSpPr><p:cNvPr id="561" name="Google Shape;561;p76"/><p:cNvCxnSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvCxnSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="457200" y="838200"/><a:ext cx="8229600" cy="0"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="straightConnector1"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln cap="flat" cmpd="thinThick" w="57150"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2FB0DC"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/><a:miter lim="800000"/><a:headEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/><a:tailEnd len="med" w="med" type="none"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:cxnSp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="A model of glucose transport into erythrocytes by GLUT1.&#xA;This has the membrane with the blue circles at the top and bottom and the inverted and upright V-shaped tubes in the middle. Toward the left is a blue image, identified as T1, with a curved shape on the left and right (curving in). In the middle is a hexagon shape that is empty. Above this is a purple hexagon identified as D-glucose. To the right of this are reversible arrows as step 1. To the right is the same image as described, but the hexagon is inside this image. To the right are reversible arrows as step 2. To the right of the arrows is another blue image to the left, but the two blue cures meet at the top and extend out at the bottom. It is identified as T2, and has a purple hexagon inside. To the right are reversible arrows as step 3. To the right is a replica of the image to the left, but the hexagon is not in the image; it is at the bottom. To the right are reversible arrows as step 4. The very right image is a replica of the first image described. A line with arrows on both end, points from the outside middle of the first blue image described, to the outside of the last image described. The line goes down and around." id="562" name="Google Shape;562;p76"/><p:cNvPicPr preferRelativeResize="0"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill rotWithShape="1"><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:alphaModFix/></a:blip><a:srcRect b="0" l="0" r="0" t="0"/><a:stretch/></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="304800" y="1304925"/><a:ext cx="8534400" cy="4248150"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>